<title>JAPAN: S&amp;P assigns AA to Australian Wheat Board Euro note.</title>
<headline>S&amp;P assigns AA to Australian Wheat Board Euro note.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-03-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Standard &amp; Poor's Corp (S&amp;P) said on Friday that it had assigned its AA rating to the Australian Wheat Board's five billion yen dual-currency Euro note due March 19, 1998.</p>
<p>The Australian Wheat Board's foreign currency long-term rating outlook is positive, S&amp;P added.</p>
</text>
